cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WindingGuard, please cite this software."
title: "WindingGuard"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Curtis"
    given-names: "Paul"
date-released: 2026-11-09
abstract: >-
  WindingGuard is an experimental, deterministic radial-continuity
  quality-assurance tool for TIFXYZ papyrus surface traces. It scores
  local radial inconsistency relative to a supplied scroll umbilicus
  and produces inspection-priority values. It is not a sheet-switch
  classifier and does not modify surface geometry.
keywords:
  - Vesuvius Challenge
  - TIFXYZ
  - virtual unwrapping
  - winding continuity
  - geometry QA
  - papyrus
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/A-PC-I/windingguard/new/main"
